WEBVTT

00:09.206 --> 00:10.689
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.689 --> 00:12.517
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.517 --> 00:13.965
- I CAN'’T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.965 --> 00:15.758
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.758 --> 00:18.931
- ♪ OHH... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.931 --> 00:21.034
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.034 --> 00:23.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.172 --> 00:25.103
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.103 --> 00:26.896
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.896 --> 00:29.103
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.103 --> 00:30.862
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.862 --> 00:33.206
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.206 --> 00:35.000
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.000 --> 00:37.034
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.034 --> 00:38.965
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.965 --> 00:40.931
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.931 --> 00:42.172
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.172 --> 00:44.448
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.448 --> 00:46.931
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.931 --> 00:49.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.241 --> 00:50.517
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:09.517 --> 01:12.310
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

01:15.965 --> 01:19.034
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:19.034 --> 01:20.310
- WHAT IS IT, BOY?
- 这是什么，男孩？

01:20.310 --> 01:22.551
- [stammering]
- [结巴]

01:22.551 --> 01:24.103
- SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝？

01:24.103 --> 01:25.103
THERE, THERE, KID.
那里，那里，孩子。

01:25.103 --> 01:26.413
WHAT'’S THE BIG "D"?
大“D”是什么？

01:26.413 --> 01:28.517
- [stammering] MR. KRABS,
- [结结巴巴]先生。螃蟹，

01:28.517 --> 01:30.551
WE'’RE ALL OUT
OF KRABBY PATTIES, SIR.
我们全力以赴
蟹肉饼，先生。

01:30.551 --> 01:33.000
- THAT'’S NOTHING
TO FUSS OVER, BOY.
- 那没什么
大惊小怪，男孩。

01:33.000 --> 01:37.413
WE'’LL JUST WHIP UP A NEW BATCH,
LIKE WE DID IN THE OLD DAYS.
我们将推出新一批，
就像我们过去所做的那样。

01:37.413 --> 01:40.068
I KNOW THIS PROCESS
LIKE THE BACK OF ME CLAW.
我知道这个过程
就像我爪子的背面。

01:40.068 --> 01:44.068
WE ALWAYS START WITH...FLOUR.
我们总是从……面粉开始。

01:44.068 --> 01:47.068
NEXT, WE ADD BARNACLE SHAVINGS.
接下来，我们添加藤壶刨花。

01:47.068 --> 01:50.206
IT'’S LIKE RIDING A BOAT CYCLE,
AIN'’T IT, BOY?
就像骑船一样，
不是吗，孩子？

01:50.206 --> 01:51.862
- YOU NEVER FORGET, BOSS MAN.
- 你永远不会忘记，老板。

01:51.862 --> 01:55.344
- WHAT DO YA SAY WE DO
THE NEXT ONE TOGETHER, EH?
- 你说我们做什么
下一个在一起，呃？

01:55.344 --> 01:56.931
SEA SALT.
- TURMERIC.
海盐。
- 姜黄。

01:56.931 --> 01:58.379
- WHAT ARE YOU ON ABOUT, BOY?
- 你在忙什么，男孩？

01:58.379 --> 01:59.931
THE THIRD STEP
IS ALWAYS SEA SALT.
第三步
始终是海盐。

01:59.931 --> 02:01.620
- THAT'’S FUNNY.
I REMEMBER TURMERIC THIRD.
- 那很好笑。
我记得姜黄第三。

02:01.620 --> 02:03.586
AND DOESN'’T THE RECIPE
CALL FOR LAND SALT?
食谱不是吗
需要陆地盐吗？

02:03.586 --> 02:05.586
- IT'’S SEA SALT.
- 这是海盐。

02:05.586 --> 02:08.068
AND DON'’T YA REMEMBER SCABS?
你不记得痂了吗？

02:08.068 --> 02:09.172
- "SCABS," SIR?
- “SCABS”，长官？

02:09.172 --> 02:10.896
- YEAH, S.C.A.B.S., YOU KNOW.
- 是的，S.C.A.B.S.，你知道的。

02:10.896 --> 02:15.103
SALT...COMES...
AFTER...BARNACLE...SHAVINGS.
盐...来了...
在……藤壶……刨花之后。

02:15.103 --> 02:18.482
OR WAS IT L.E.S.I.O.N.S.?
还是 L.E.S.I.O.N.S.？

02:18.482 --> 02:20.793
NO, THAT DOESN'’T
SOUND RIGHT EITHER.
不，那不是
听起来也不错。

02:20.793 --> 02:21.862
- WAS IT WAS "PUSTULE"?
- 这是“脓包”吗？

02:21.862 --> 02:22.896
- HEAVENS, NO.
- 天哪，不。

02:22.896 --> 02:24.482
THAT'’S DISGUSTING.
这太恶心了。

02:24.482 --> 02:26.068
ALL RIGHT,
TELL YA WHAT:
好吧，
告诉你什么：

02:26.068 --> 02:27.689
WHY DON'’T I JUST GO
FETCH THE FORMULA?
我为什么不走
获取公式？

02:27.689 --> 02:29.310
WE'’LL SETTLE THIS
ONCE AND FOR ALL.
我们会解决这个问题
一劳永逸。

02:29.310 --> 02:32.310
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:32.310 --> 02:33.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:33.620 --> 02:35.793
NO NEED TO WONDER ABOUT THIS.
无需想知道这一点。

02:35.793 --> 02:37.551
I GOT YOUR FORMULA.
我得到了你的公式。

02:37.551 --> 02:38.931
[laughs]
[笑]

02:38.931 --> 02:40.103
YEE-HAW!
呀呀！

02:40.103 --> 02:41.862
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:41.862 --> 02:44.931
- AREN'’T YOU GETTING A LITTLE
TIRED OF THIS, PLANKTON?
- 你没有得到一点吗
厌倦了这个，浮游生物？

02:44.931 --> 02:46.517
- COME ON, KRABS.
- 来吧，蟹蟹。

02:46.517 --> 02:48.620
DON'’T YOU HAVE ANY RESPECT
FOR TRADITION?
你一点尊重都没有吗
为了传统？

02:48.620 --> 02:49.793
- HO, HO, HO.
- 嗬，嗬，嗬。

02:49.793 --> 02:51.379
OF COURSE I DO.
我当然愿意。

02:51.379 --> 02:53.586
THAT'’S WHY I'’M DOING THIS.
这就是我这样做的原因。

02:53.586 --> 02:55.344
[rocket blasting]
[火箭爆破]

02:55.344 --> 02:56.896
[glass shattering]
- [moaning]
[玻璃破碎]
- [呻吟]

02:56.896 --> 02:59.000
- I NEED TO SOMEHOW GET PLANKTON
- 我需要以某种方式获取浮游生物

02:59.000 --> 03:01.241
TO STOP COMING AFTER
ME PRECIOUS FORMULA.
停止追随
我珍贵的配方。

03:01.241 --> 03:03.275
- HMM...I KNOW.
- 嗯...我知道。

03:03.275 --> 03:05.172
TO KEEP GARY
OUT OF THE BISCUIT TIN,
为了留住加里
从饼干罐中取出，

03:05.172 --> 03:08.655
I HIDE THE BISCUITS SOMEWHERE
FAR AWAY, LIKE PATRICK'’S HOUSE.
我把饼干藏在某个地方
很远，就像帕特里克的房子。

03:08.655 --> 03:11.172
UNFORTUNATELY, PATRICK ENDS UP
EATING THE BISCUITS ANYWAY.
不幸的是，帕特里克最终落败
无论如何都要吃饼干。

03:11.172 --> 03:14.275
- SPONGEBOB, THAT'’S IT,
YOU GENIUS.
- 海绵宝宝，就是这样，
你是天才。

03:14.275 --> 03:16.379
YOU JUST SOLVED
ME DECADES-OLD DILEMMA.
你刚刚解决了
我几十年来一直面临的困境。

03:16.379 --> 03:18.068
- I'’M WARNING YOU, MR. KRABS,
- 我警告你，先生。螃蟹，

03:18.068 --> 03:20.241
PATRICK WILL EAT ANYTHING
YOU GIVE HIM.
帕特里克什么都吃
你给他。

03:20.241 --> 03:23.896
- BREAKING NEWS:
EARLIER TODAY, MR. EUGENE KRABS,
- 突发新闻：
今天早些时候，先生。尤金·克拉布斯，

03:23.896 --> 03:25.931
PROPRIETOR
OF THE KRUSTY KRAB RESTAURANT,
业主
蟹堡王餐厅的

03:25.931 --> 03:28.517
PARTED WITH HIS
BELOVED SECRET FORMULA.
与他分手
深受喜爱的秘密配方。

03:28.517 --> 03:31.413
WE NOW GO TO PERCH PERKINS,
LIVE ON THE SCENE.
我们现在去PERCH PERKINS，
现场直播。

03:31.413 --> 03:32.413
- THANKS, ELAINE.
- 谢谢，伊莱恩。

03:32.413 --> 03:33.931
JUST MOMENTS AGO,
就在不久前，

03:33.931 --> 03:35.758
EUGENE KRABS SENT
HIS FAMOUSLY DELICIOUS
尤金·克拉布斯发送
他家的美味出名

03:35.758 --> 03:37.551
SECRET KRABBY PATTY FORMULA
PACKING.
蟹肉饼的秘密配方
包装。

03:37.551 --> 03:39.586
- TAKE CARE OF YERSELF,
LITTLE FORMULER.
- 照顾好自己，
小配方师。

03:42.586 --> 03:45.379
[sirens blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

03:58.103 --> 04:00.241
- GOOD-BYE, SECRET RECIPE.
- 再见，秘密食谱。

04:00.241 --> 04:04.206
- WE WANTED TO ASK
MR. EUGENE KRABS
- 我们想问
先生。尤金·克拉布斯

04:04.206 --> 04:06.965
WHAT COMPELLED HIM
TO TAKE SUCH DRASTIC MEASURES.
是什么迫使他
采取如此严厉的措施。

04:06.965 --> 04:08.620
- WELL, IT'’S SIMPLE, PERCH.
- 嗯，很简单，鲈鱼。

04:08.620 --> 04:10.793
IT SEEMS KEEPING
ME SECRET FORMULA AT HAND
看起来还在继续
我手头的秘密配方

04:10.793 --> 04:12.344
HAS PROVEN TO BE
ALL TOO TEMPTING
已被证明是
太诱人了

04:12.344 --> 04:13.896
FOR A CERTAIN DIMINUTIVE,
对于某个小人物来说，

04:13.896 --> 04:16.034
ONE-EYED CRIMINAL ELEMENT
OF SOCIETY.
独眼犯罪分子
社会的。

04:16.034 --> 04:19.482
- SO I FINALLY GOT HIM
IN FULL RETREAT.
- 所以我终于找到了他
全面撤退。

04:19.482 --> 04:22.241
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

04:26.275 --> 04:29.448
- ALL RIGHT, BOY, LET'’S GET BACK
TO MAKING THEM PATTIES.
- 好吧，孩子，我们回去吧
给他们做馅饼。

04:29.448 --> 04:31.068
- I BELIEVE WE WERE AT TURMERIC.
- 我相信我们在姜黄。

04:31.068 --> 04:34.068
- BOY, I THOUGHT I TOLD YA--
- 男孩，我想我已经告诉过你了——

04:34.068 --> 04:35.758
- OH, NO.
WE FORGOT TO LOOK AT THE--
- 哦，不。
我们忘记看——

04:35.758 --> 04:37.620
- FORMULER, YEAH.
- 配方师，是的。

04:37.620 --> 04:39.758
- AND THAT FORMULA IS...
- 这个公式是......

04:39.758 --> 04:44.241
- ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE
OF THE OCEAN, YEAH.
- 在对面
海洋的，是的。

04:44.241 --> 04:46.448
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:46.448 --> 04:52.620
AND NOW I'’VE GOT TO GO
ALL THE WAY THERE TO GET IT.
现在我得走了
一路走来，获取它。

04:52.620 --> 04:53.793
- MR. KRABS?
- 先生。螃蟹？

04:53.793 --> 04:55.241
I'’LL DO IT.
我会做的。

04:55.241 --> 04:57.103
SEND ME TO RETRIEVE
THAT FORMULA.
派我去取回
那个公式。

04:57.103 --> 04:58.482
- THINK YOU'’RE UP
FOR THE CHALLENGE?
- 认为你已经起来了
为了挑战？

04:58.482 --> 04:59.482
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

04:59.482 --> 05:01.241
- WELL, ALL RIGHT, THEN.
- 好吧，那么。

05:01.241 --> 05:05.172
THE FORMULER IS NOW STOWED
IN A SAFE DEPOSIT BOX
配方师现已收起
在保险箱中

05:05.172 --> 05:07.931
IN THE OCEAN'’S LARGEST,
SAFEST BANK
在最大的海洋中，
最安全银行

05:07.931 --> 05:10.137
IN WAYFAROUT TOWNVILLE.
在遥远的汤维尔。

05:10.137 --> 05:13.724
- AH, AND THAT'’S THE KEY
TO THE BOX, EH, MR. KRABS?
- 啊，这就是关键
到盒子里，呃，先生。螃蟹？

05:13.724 --> 05:14.793
- THIS?
- 这？

05:14.793 --> 05:17.034
NO, THIS IS THE KEY TO ME HEART.
不，这是我心的钥匙。

05:20.517 --> 05:23.586
THIS IS
THE SAFE DEPOSIT BOX KEY.
这是
保险箱钥匙。

05:23.586 --> 05:25.896
- OH, THANK YOU, MISTER--
- NOT SO FAST, KID.
-哦，谢谢你，先生--
- 别那么快，孩子。

05:25.896 --> 05:28.482
I WANT YOU TO PROTECT THIS
AT ALL COSTS.
我希望你保护这个
不惜一切代价。

05:28.482 --> 05:30.344
YOU MUSTN'’T LET IT
OUT OF YOUR SIGHT.
你一定不能让它发生
在你的视线之外。

05:30.344 --> 05:35.482
I NOW BESTOW UNTO YOU THE KEY TO
THE FUTURE OF THE KRUSTY KRAB.
我现在将钥匙授予您
甲壳蟹的未来。

05:35.482 --> 05:37.172
- I HUMBLY ACCEPT THIS KEY
- 我谦虚地接受这把钥匙

05:37.172 --> 05:39.620
AND VOW TO GUARD IT
WITH MY VERY LIFE.
并发誓守护它
用我的生命。

05:39.620 --> 05:41.551
IT SHAN'’T LEAVETH MINE SIGHT.
它不会离开我的视线。

05:41.551 --> 05:43.724
- GOOD, LET'’S GET YOU
OVER TO THE TRAIN STATION.
- 很好，让我们来接你吧
到火车站。

05:43.724 --> 05:45.827
- THIS IS TOO EASY.
- 这太简单了。

05:45.827 --> 05:48.724
KAREN, I'’M OFF
ON A BUSINESS TRIP.
凯伦，我走了
商务旅行。

05:48.724 --> 05:50.241
DON'’T WAIT UP FOR ME, BABY.
别等我，宝贝。

05:53.137 --> 05:55.206
- THE OCEANIC EXPRESS.
- 海洋快车。

05:55.206 --> 05:56.655
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

05:56.655 --> 05:58.379
WISH ME LUCK.
祝我好运。

05:58.379 --> 05:59.724
- REMEMBER WHAT I TOLD YOU, BOY.
- 记住我告诉你的话，孩子。

05:59.724 --> 06:01.482
KEEP YOUR EYE ON THE KEY.
密切关注关键。

06:01.482 --> 06:03.413
- I CAN TAKE YOUR LUGGAGE, SIR.
- 先生，我可以帮您拿行李。

06:03.413 --> 06:06.172
PLEASE FOLLOW ME.
请跟我来。

06:06.172 --> 06:07.241
- WOW,
A REAL-LIFE BUTLER.
- 哇，
现实生活中的管家。

06:07.241 --> 06:09.586
- I AM NOT A BUTLER.
- 我不是管家。

06:09.586 --> 06:11.655
- ALL ABOARD.
- 全部上车。

06:11.655 --> 06:13.275
- BYE, MR. KRABS.
- BYE, MR.螃蟹。

06:13.275 --> 06:14.517
- GOOD LUCK, ME BOY.
- 祝你好运，我的孩子。

06:14.517 --> 06:15.793
DON'’T LET ME DOWN.
别让我失望。

06:15.793 --> 06:17.379
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

06:17.379 --> 06:19.551
[wheels creaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

06:21.103 --> 06:22.586
- WAIT!
- 等待！

06:22.586 --> 06:24.103
WAIT FOR ME!
等我！

06:24.103 --> 06:25.965
UGH. BARNACLES.
啊。藤壶。

06:25.965 --> 06:28.206
I KNEW I SHOULD HAVE SPRUNG
FOR A TAXI.
我知道我应该跳起来
出租车。

06:28.206 --> 06:30.482
CURSE YOU, PUBLIC TRANSPORT.
诅咒你，公共交通。

06:30.482 --> 06:31.448
WHY, I OUGHT TO--
为什么，我应该——

06:33.448 --> 06:35.482
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:35.482 --> 06:37.758
OH, NOW THEY'’RE ON TIME.
哦，现在他们准时了。

06:37.758 --> 06:39.103
[moaning]
[呻吟]

06:40.551 --> 06:42.517
- YOUR SLEEPING QUARTERS.
- 您的睡眠区。

06:42.517 --> 06:44.000
crash!
碰撞！

06:44.000 --> 06:46.482
I TRUST EVERYTHING
IS TO YOUR LIKING.
我相信一切
符合您的喜好。

06:46.482 --> 06:48.655
- COULDN'’T BE BETTER, BUTLER.
- 不能更好了，巴特勒。

06:48.655 --> 06:49.931
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

06:49.931 --> 06:51.620
PERHAPS MONSIEUR
DID NOT HEAR ME.
也许先生
没听见我说话。

06:51.620 --> 06:56.000
I TRUST EVERYTHING
IS TO YOUR...LIKING?
我相信一切
您...喜欢吗？

06:56.000 --> 06:58.034
- OH, OH, YES, OF COURSE.
- 哦，哦，是的，当然。

06:58.034 --> 06:59.137
HOW SILLY OF ME.
我真傻。

06:59.137 --> 07:01.517
- AN HONEST MISTAKE, MONSIEUR.
- 一个诚实的错误，先生。

07:01.517 --> 07:03.448
- THANK YOU, MY GOOD MAN.
- 谢谢你，我的好人。

07:03.448 --> 07:05.862
I'’VE BEEN HUNTING FOR A TRASH
CAN FOR AT LEAST TEN MINUTES.
我一直在寻找垃圾
可以持续至少十分钟。

07:05.862 --> 07:08.344
THANKS AGAIN, FRENCH GUY.
再次感谢，法国人。

07:08.344 --> 07:10.000
- PEEKABOO.
- 躲猫猫。

07:10.000 --> 07:11.517
- HEY, PATRICK, REMEMBER,
- 嘿，帕特里克，记住，

07:11.517 --> 07:13.275
WE'’RE ON AN IMPORTANT
MISSION HERE,
我们正处于重要时刻
使命在这里，

07:13.275 --> 07:17.689
SO KEEP YOUR EYES OPEN
FOR ANY SUSPICIOUS CHARACTERS.
所以请睁大眼睛
对于任何可疑人物。

07:17.689 --> 07:22.655
- SPONGEBOB, DOES THAT GUY
LOOK SUSPICIOUS TO YOU?
- 海绵宝宝，那家伙是吗？
您看起来很可疑吗？

07:22.655 --> 07:24.413
I THINK HE MIGHT
BE SPYING ON US.
我认为他可能
监视我们。

07:24.413 --> 07:25.896
HEY, WHERE'’D HE GO?
嘿，他去哪儿了？

07:25.896 --> 07:27.862
ALL THIS SUSPICION
IS MAKING ME HUNGRY.
所有这些怀疑
让我饿了。

07:27.862 --> 07:31.241
- WELL, THEN FOLLOW ME
TO THE DINING CAR.
- 好吧，那就跟我来
到餐车。

07:33.896 --> 07:35.620
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:35.620 --> 07:39.482
LOOKS LIKE IT'’S STARTING
TO ROLL MY WAY FOR A CHANGE,
看起来开始了
为改变而努力，

07:39.482 --> 07:42.137
AND NOTHING DARE STAND
IN MY WAY!
无人敢站立
以我的方式！

07:42.137 --> 07:43.103
[horn honking]
UH-OH.
[喇叭鸣响]
呃-哦。

07:43.103 --> 07:44.827
crash!
碰撞！

07:44.827 --> 07:45.655
[horn honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

07:50.896 --> 07:53.000
I KNEW I'’D MAKE IT.
我知道我会成功。

07:56.172 --> 07:58.448
- OOH, FANCY.
- YEAH.
- 噢，太棒了。
- 是的。

07:58.448 --> 08:01.827
AND THEY GIVE YOU SO MUCH FOOD,
YOU NEED TWO FORKS.
他们给你很多食物，
你需要两把叉子。

08:01.827 --> 08:04.827
[baby crying]
[婴儿哭声]

08:04.827 --> 08:07.275
- OH, WHAT A CUTE LITTLE BABY.
- 哦，多可爱的小宝贝。

08:07.275 --> 08:09.655
NO NEED TO FUSS, LITTLE FELLA.
没必要大惊小怪，小家伙。

08:09.655 --> 08:12.862
- I JUST CAN'’T GET HIM
TO STOP CRYING, THE POOR DEAR.
- 我就是抓不到他
停止哭泣，亲爱的穷人。

08:12.862 --> 08:15.482
[baby crying]
[婴儿哭声]

08:15.482 --> 08:17.310
- HI AGAIN, KIND BUTLER.
- 再次嗨，善良的管家。

08:17.310 --> 08:19.000
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:19.000 --> 08:22.862
SO SORRY, MONSIEUR.
THE DINING CAR IS CLOSED NOW.
非常抱歉，先生。
餐车现已关闭。

08:22.862 --> 08:24.724
- BUT WE HAVEN'’T EVEN
HEARD THE SPECIAL YET.
- 但我们还没有
还没有听到特别的消息。

08:24.724 --> 08:27.241
- NO, THE DINING CAR
IS OVER FOR YOU.
- 不，餐车
你已经结束了。

08:27.241 --> 08:29.965
YOU MUST LEAVE NOW.
你现在必须离开。

08:29.965 --> 08:32.137
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:32.137 --> 08:33.655
OH, SORRY, MA'’AM.
哦，对不起，女士。

08:33.655 --> 08:35.655
- THAT'’S QUITE ALL RIGHT,
HANDSOME.
- 没关系，
英俊。

08:35.655 --> 08:37.655
- HUH.
FRIENDLY LADY.
- 嗯。
友好的女士。

08:37.655 --> 08:39.620
WELL, PATRICK, WE BETTER FIND
A SAFE PLACE
好吧，帕特里克，我们最好找到
安全的地方

08:39.620 --> 08:41.206
TO STORE THIS FOR THE NIGHT.
将此储存过夜。

08:41.206 --> 08:42.620
- WHAT IS THAT?
- 那是什么？

08:42.620 --> 08:45.241
- THAT, MY DEAR PATRICK, IS--
THE KEY!
- 那，我亲爱的帕特里克，是——
关键！

08:45.241 --> 08:46.517
PATRICK, WHERE'’S THE KEY?
帕特里克，钥匙在哪里？

08:46.517 --> 08:48.137
OH, NO!
I TOOK A SOLEMN OATH.
哦，不！
我庄严宣誓。

08:48.137 --> 08:50.862
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

08:50.862 --> 08:53.896
- PLANKTON, YOU STOLE
THE SAFETY DEPOSIT KEY!
- 浮游生物，你偷了
保险箱钥匙！

08:53.896 --> 08:55.724
- OH, COME ON.
I JUST GOT HERE.
- 哦，来吧。
我刚到这里。

08:55.724 --> 08:58.310
I COULDN'’T HAVE STOLEN IT...YET.
我还不能偷它。

08:58.310 --> 08:59.862
- OH, YEAH?
- 哦，是吗？

08:59.862 --> 09:02.551
WELL, NO OFFENSE,
BUT I DON'’T BELIEVE YOU.
好吧，无意冒犯，
但我不相信你。

09:02.551 --> 09:04.310
- YOU CALLING ME A LIAR?
- 你说我是骗子？

09:04.310 --> 09:05.482
- YES.
- 是的。

09:05.482 --> 09:06.758
SEARCH HIM, PATRICK.
搜他，帕特里克。

09:06.758 --> 09:08.758
- WITH PLEASURE.
[glove snaps]
- 荣幸。
[手套按扣]

09:08.758 --> 09:12.000
PREPARE FOR A THOROUGH SEARCH,
SHORTY.
准备彻底搜索，
矮个子。

09:12.000 --> 09:13.034
- OH, DREAD.
- 哦，可怕。

09:13.034 --> 09:15.724
- AFTER I SCRUB THIS BOWL.
- 在我擦洗这个碗之后。

09:15.724 --> 09:17.482
ALL RIGHT, PLANKTON,
好吧，浮游生物，

09:17.482 --> 09:19.862
TIME TO SQUEEZE THE KEY
OUT OF YOU.
是时候按下钥匙了
脱离你。

09:19.862 --> 09:22.000
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:22.000 --> 09:23.068
[nut crunching]
[坚果嚼碎]

09:23.068 --> 09:25.310
- MMM, AFTER MY TASTY SNACK.
- 嗯，吃完美味的零食后。

09:25.310 --> 09:26.379
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:26.379 --> 09:27.793
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:29.103 --> 09:30.103
- HE'’S CLEAN.
- 他很干净。

09:30.103 --> 09:31.206
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:31.206 --> 09:33.758
I TOLD YOU I WASN'’T LYING.
我告诉过你我没有说谎。

09:33.758 --> 09:36.931
- WELL, IF YOU DIDN'’T STEAL IT,
THEN WHO DID?
- 好吧，如果你没有偷它，
那么是谁干的呢？

09:36.931 --> 09:38.758
MUST HAVE BEEN
SOMEONE ON THIS TRAIN.
一定是
这列火车上有人。

09:38.758 --> 09:40.034
PATRICK, CALL THE COPS.
帕特里克，报警。

09:40.034 --> 09:43.206
- COPS, I NEED YOU!
- 警察，我需要你！

09:43.206 --> 09:45.103
all: WE WANT KRABBY PATTIES!
所有人：我们想要蟹肉饼！

09:45.103 --> 09:47.310
WE WANT KRABBY PATTIES!
我们想要蟹肉饼！

09:47.310 --> 09:49.137
WE WANT KRABBY PATTIES!
我们想要蟹肉饼！

09:49.137 --> 09:51.034
WE WANT KRABBY PATTIES!
我们想要蟹肉饼！

09:51.034 --> 09:53.344
WE WANT KRABBY PATTIES!
我们想要蟹肉饼！

09:53.344 --> 09:55.172
- JUST GIVE ME A PATTY, MAN.
- 给我一块肉饼吧，伙计。

09:55.172 --> 09:58.310
- FOR THE LAST TIME,
WE'’RE OUT OF PATTIES.
- 最后一次，
我们没有馅饼了。

09:58.310 --> 09:59.758
[all yelling at once]
[大家同时喊叫]

09:59.758 --> 10:02.137
NO NEED TO GET EXCITED, NOW.
现在无需兴奋。

10:02.137 --> 10:04.310
- WE WANT OUR PATTIES, MAN.
- 我们想要我们的肉饼，伙计。

10:04.310 --> 10:06.206
[sparks crackling]
[火花噼啪作响]

10:06.206 --> 10:08.068
- THAT'’S KRUSTY KRAB PROPERTY.
- 那是蟹堡王的财产。

10:08.068 --> 10:09.275
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:09.275 --> 10:11.586
- THAT'’S A LOAD-BEARING COLUMN.
- 那是一个承重柱。

10:11.586 --> 10:14.000
HURRY, SPONGEBOB.
快点，海绵宝宝。

10:14.000 --> 10:15.724
- AS YOU KNOW,
- 如你所知，

10:15.724 --> 10:18.275
AN UNSPEAKABLE CRIME HAS BEEN
COMMITTED HERE TODAY,
无法形容的罪行已经发生
今天在这里承诺，

10:18.275 --> 10:20.827
AND EACH OF YOU
HAD THE MEANS TO DO IT.
还有你们每个人
有办法做到这一点。

10:20.827 --> 10:23.379
THE QUESTION IS, WHO?
问题是，谁？

10:23.379 --> 10:25.034
YOU THERE.
你在那里。

10:25.034 --> 10:27.379
YOU'’RE NOT FOOLING ME
WITH THAT INNOCENT ACT.
你没有骗我
带着这种无辜的行为。

10:27.379 --> 10:29.793
WHERE WERE YOU AT 6:42 P.M.
ON THE NIGHT OF JANUARY 16TH?
下午 6:42 你在哪里
1 月 16 日晚上？

10:29.793 --> 10:31.655
AND DON'’T YOU GIVE ME
THAT "GOO-GOO, GA-GA" STUFF.
你不给我吗
那些“咕咕，嘎嘎”的东西。

10:31.655 --> 10:33.068
- OH, BROTHER.
- 哦，兄弟。

10:33.068 --> 10:34.413
- MR. POLICE COMMISSIONER?
- 先生。警察局长？

10:34.413 --> 10:35.862
- YES, MR. SQUAREPANTS?
- 是的，先生。方裤？

10:35.862 --> 10:37.413
- I SUB--
- 我SUB--

10:37.413 --> 10:40.172
I SUBMIT TO YOU
THAT THE PERPETRATOR
我向你提交
肇事者

10:40.172 --> 10:43.724
OF THIS HEINOUS THEFT
IS NONE OTHER THAN...
这起令人发指的盗窃案
不是别人，正是……

10:43.724 --> 10:44.931
THE NANNY.
保姆。

10:44.931 --> 10:46.137
- [laughs nervously]
- [紧张地笑]

10:46.137 --> 10:48.517
I HAVEN'’T STOLEN A THING.
我没有偷任何东西。

10:48.517 --> 10:51.931
- SIR, IF YOU SEARCH
THIS BABY'’S DIAPER,
- 先生，如果您搜索的话
这个婴儿的尿布，

10:51.931 --> 10:53.344
YOU'’LL FIND THE STOLEN KEY.
您会找到被盗的钥匙。

10:53.344 --> 10:56.793
- YES, MR. SQUAREPANTS.
- 是的，先生。方裤。

10:56.793 --> 10:57.931
HMM.
唔。

10:57.931 --> 10:59.620
[metal clanking]
AHA!
[金属叮当作响]
啊哈！

10:59.620 --> 11:00.724
- THE KEY.
- 钥匙。

11:00.724 --> 11:02.827
- AT LAST, I FOUND IT!
- 我终于找到了！

11:02.827 --> 11:03.931
- EH?
-呃？

11:03.931 --> 11:05.620
- THANK YOU, MR. SQUAREPANTS.
- 谢谢你，先生。方裤。

11:05.620 --> 11:08.379
YOU UNCOVERED
NEPTUNE'’S JEWEL OF THE SEA
你发现了
海王星的海洋明珠

11:08.379 --> 11:11.862
AND NABBED THE INFAMOUS
JEWEL TRIPLETS GANG.
并抓住了臭名昭著的人
珠宝三胞胎帮。

11:11.862 --> 11:13.448
- TRIPLETS?
- 三胞胎？

11:13.448 --> 11:15.172
- I TOLD YOU TAKING THE TRAIN
WAS A MISTAKE.
- 我告诉过你坐火车
是一个错误。

11:15.172 --> 11:16.862
- WELL, WE WOULDN'’T BE
ON THE LAM
- 好吧，我们不会的
林中

11:16.862 --> 11:19.206
IF YOU HADN'’T APPLIED
FOR THAT DISCOUNT CARD.
如果您没有申请
对于那张折扣卡。

11:19.206 --> 11:21.413
- WHOA, CAN I HELP IT
IF I'’M FRUGAL?
- 哇，我能帮忙吗
如果我很节俭？

11:21.413 --> 11:23.862
- TELL IT TO YOUR CELLMATE,
JUNIOR.
- 告诉你的狱友，
初级。

11:23.862 --> 11:25.344
- IF THEY DIDN'’T DO IT,
- 如果他们不这样做，

11:25.344 --> 11:27.517
THAT MEANS THE KEY
WAS STOLEN BY...
这意味着关键
被偷了...

11:27.517 --> 11:28.620
THE BUTLER!
管家！

11:28.620 --> 11:29.965
- UGH.
- 呃。

11:29.965 --> 11:31.344
I CERTAINLY DID NOT.
我当然没有。

11:31.344 --> 11:33.379
- WE KNOW YOU DID IT.
- 我们知道你做到了。

11:33.379 --> 11:35.241
THE BUTLER ALWAYS
COMMITS THE CRIME.
管家总是
犯罪。

11:35.241 --> 11:37.758
- FOR THE LAST TIME,
I AM NOT A BUTLER.
- 最后一次，
我不是管家。

11:37.758 --> 11:39.862
I DON'’T EVEN HAVE
THE BUTLER ACCENT.
我什至没有
巴特勒口音。

11:39.862 --> 11:41.896
- YOU MAY NOT BE A BUTLER,
- 你可能不是管家，

11:41.896 --> 11:44.000
BUT ARE YOU A WEREWOLF?
但你是狼人吗？

11:46.517 --> 11:48.862
[wolf howling]
[狼嚎]

11:48.862 --> 11:51.793
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:51.793 --> 11:54.586
[snarling]
[咆哮]

11:55.793 --> 11:58.448
[howling]
[嚎叫]

11:58.448 --> 12:00.310
[snarling]
[咆哮]

12:03.758 --> 12:05.172
- OKAY, BUTLER,
- 好吧，巴特勒，

12:05.172 --> 12:06.241
YOU MAY HAVE HOODWINKED
THE SPONGE,
你可能被蒙蔽了
海绵，

12:06.241 --> 12:07.827
BUT I AIN'’T NO PUSHOVER.
但我不是一个容易被欺负的人。

12:07.827 --> 12:09.034
AH.
啊。

12:09.034 --> 12:10.482
- SORRY.
- 对不起。

12:10.482 --> 12:12.137
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

12:12.137 --> 12:14.724
- ANYWAY, SINCE YOU
DIDN'’T STEAL THE KEY,
- 无论如何，既然你
没有偷钥匙，

12:14.724 --> 12:17.379
THEN YOU'’D OBVIOUSLY SUBMIT
TO A SEARCH OF YOUR CABIN.
那么你显然会提交
搜查您的小屋。

12:17.379 --> 12:18.620
- I DO NOT HAVE A CABIN.
- 我没有小屋。

12:18.620 --> 12:20.448
I SLEEP ON THE LUGGAGE.
我睡在行李上。

12:20.448 --> 12:22.517
- AHA!
THAT'’S HOW YOU STOLE IT.
- 啊哈！
你就是这样偷的。

12:22.517 --> 12:23.896
GIVE IT TO ME.
GIVE ME THE KEY.
把它给我。
给我钥匙。

12:23.896 --> 12:26.241
- NEED I REMIND YOU, PLANKTON,
- 需要我提醒你吗，浮游生物，

12:26.241 --> 12:28.862
THAT YOU ARE STILL
A SUSPECT YOURSELF?
你仍然是
你自己也是嫌疑人吗？

12:28.862 --> 12:32.068
- UH, I MEAN
GIVE SPONGEBOB BACK THE KEY.
- 呃，我的意思是
把钥匙还给海绵宝宝。

12:32.068 --> 12:33.758
- I DON'’T BELIEVE EITHER OF YOU.
- 我都不相信你们。

12:33.758 --> 12:36.448
SHAKE '’EM DOWN.
摇晃他们。

12:36.448 --> 12:38.862
[change clinking]
[变叮当]

12:38.862 --> 12:40.103
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

12:40.103 --> 12:41.241
[grunts]
[咕哝]

12:41.241 --> 12:42.620
[gasps]
[喘气]

12:42.620 --> 12:44.586
UGH.
啊。

12:44.586 --> 12:48.793
- NOTHING SUSPICIOUS HERE,
- 这里没有什么可疑的，

12:48.793 --> 12:51.896
EXCEPT FOR THE FACT
THAT YOU HAVE JUST OUTED
除了事实
您刚刚发布的

12:51.896 --> 12:55.206
ORIN J. ROUGHY,
INTERNATIONAL FUGITIVE
奥林·J·拉夫，
国际逃犯

12:55.206 --> 12:59.241
WANTED FOR THE EMBEZZLEMENT OF
OVER 75,000 BUCKS'’ WORTH OF...
因贪污罪被通缉
价值超过 75,000 美元...

12:59.241 --> 13:00.827
HAM SANDWICHES.
火腿三明治。

13:00.827 --> 13:02.068
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

13:02.068 --> 13:03.724
- [squeaks]
- [吱吱声]

13:03.724 --> 13:05.448
AFTER ALL THIS,
I STILL HAVEN'’T FOUND THE KEY,
经过这一切之后，
我还没找到钥匙，

13:05.448 --> 13:09.137
AND I BROKE MY VOW TO MR. KRABS.
我违背了对先生的誓言。螃蟹。

13:09.137 --> 13:13.000
I DON'’T DESERVE TO WORK
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
我不值得工作
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

13:13.000 --> 13:16.724
- DON'’T WORRY, BUDDY.
I'’M SURE IT'’LL TURN UP.
- 别担心，伙计。
我确信它会出现。

13:16.724 --> 13:20.241
- THE KEY!
- 关键！

13:20.241 --> 13:23.862
PATRICK, WHERE IN THE OCEAN'’S
DEPTHS DID YOU FIND IT?
帕特里克，在海洋的哪个地方
深度 你找到了吗？

13:23.862 --> 13:26.620
- I FOUND IT
WHEN I WAS CLEANING YOUR SHORTS
- 我找到了
当我清洁你的短裤时

13:26.620 --> 13:29.206
FROM YOUR
LITTLE "ACCIDENT" EARLIER.
来自您的
之前的一个小“意外”。

13:29.206 --> 13:31.206
- WELL, THAT IS GREAT NEWS.
- 嗯，这是个好消息。

13:31.206 --> 13:33.586
- [yawning] ANYWAYS...
- [打哈欠] 无论如何......

13:33.586 --> 13:35.413
I'’M GONNA HIT THE SACK.
我要睡觉了。

13:35.413 --> 13:36.448
I'’M POOPED.
我大便了。

13:36.448 --> 13:38.137
I'’M SURE YOU CAN RELATE.
我相信你能感同身受。

13:38.137 --> 13:40.862
- UH...YEAH, ME TOO.
- 呃...是的，我也是。

13:40.862 --> 13:42.620
[train whistle blowing]
【火车鸣笛】

13:42.620 --> 13:44.655
- ME THREE.
- 我三个。

13:46.034 --> 13:49.620
[train engine chugging]
[火车引擎嘎嘎作响]

13:49.620 --> 13:52.103
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

13:52.103 --> 13:53.586
- EXCUSE ME.
- HEY.
- 打扰一下。
- 嘿。

13:53.586 --> 13:55.379
WOULD YOU MIND SCOOCHING OVER?
你介意过来吗？

13:55.379 --> 13:57.448
I CAN'’T EVEN MOVE MY EYEBROWS.
我的眉毛都动不了。

13:57.448 --> 13:59.068
- I'’M TRYING.
- 我想。

13:59.068 --> 14:01.586
SHEESH, THIS ISN'’T EXACTLY
A LUXURY SUITE.
嘘，这不完全是这样
豪华套房。

14:01.586 --> 14:05.103
- HERE, MAYBE I CAN HELP.
- 在这里，也许我可以帮忙。

14:05.103 --> 14:07.758
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

14:07.758 --> 14:09.586
- AH, FRESH WATER.
- 啊，淡水。

14:09.586 --> 14:12.172
- WHAT A COOL VIEW.
- 多么酷的景色啊。

14:12.172 --> 14:14.379
- YEAH, HAVE A BETTER LOOK.
- 是的，仔细看看。

14:14.379 --> 14:15.827
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

14:15.827 --> 14:18.620
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

14:21.034 --> 14:23.206
AND THANKS FOR THE KEY.
感谢您的钥匙。

14:23.206 --> 14:26.000
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

14:27.482 --> 14:29.586
- WELL, I GUESS HE LOST US.
- 好吧，我猜他失去了我们。

14:29.586 --> 14:33.206
YOU READY TO CALL IT A DAY,
SPONGEBOB?
您准备好收工了，
海绵宝宝？

14:33.206 --> 14:34.000
GUESS NOT.
我猜不会。

14:37.931 --> 14:39.551
- OKAY, PATRICK,
ON THE COUNT OF THREE,
- 好吧，帕特里克，
数到三，

14:39.551 --> 14:40.793
WE'’LL JUMP ON, OKAY?
我们继续前进，好吗？

14:40.793 --> 14:42.275
- GOT YA, PAL.
- 明白了，朋友。

14:42.275 --> 14:44.620
OH, WAIT,
I CAN'’T COUNT THAT HIGH.
哦，等等，
我数不出来那么高。

14:44.620 --> 14:46.551
CAN WE JUST JUMP
ON THE COUNT OF ONE?
我们可以跳吗
数一？

14:46.551 --> 14:48.206
- THAT'’LL WORK TOO.
- 那也行。

14:48.206 --> 14:50.413
OKAY, ON THE COUNT OF--
WHAT THE--
好吧，因为——
什么——

14:53.931 --> 14:55.413
- GREAT. NOW WHAT?
- 伟大的。现在怎么办？

14:58.620 --> 15:00.275
- PATRICK, HOP UP ON MY BACK.
- 帕特里克，跳到我的背上。

15:00.275 --> 15:02.068
- WELL, I DON'’T THINK
THIS IS THE RIGHT TIME
- 嗯，我不认为
现在正是时候

15:02.068 --> 15:03.448
FOR A PIGGYBACK RIDE.
背负式骑行。

15:03.448 --> 15:05.655
- JUST DO IT.
- OKAY.
- 去做就对了。
- 好的。

15:05.655 --> 15:07.862
BUT I DON'’T SEE HOW THIS
IS GOING TO GET US ANY CLOSER
但我不明白这是怎么回事
会让我们更接近

15:07.862 --> 15:10.103
TO THAT--
[screaming]
为此——
[尖叫]

15:10.103 --> 15:11.172
ARE YOU CRAZY?
你疯了？

15:11.172 --> 15:12.965
[screaming]
[尖叫]

15:12.965 --> 15:15.758
PLEASE, I'’M SORRY
FOR ANY GRIEF I'’VE CAUSED YOU.
拜托，对不起
对于我给你带来的任何悲伤。

15:15.758 --> 15:17.482
DON'’T DO IT, PLEASE!
请不要这样做！

15:21.896 --> 15:23.172
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:23.172 --> 15:24.896
HEY.
嘿。

15:24.896 --> 15:27.137
WE'’RE FLYING.
我们正在飞翔。

15:27.137 --> 15:29.862
- HERE YA GO, BUDDY.
- 好了，伙计。

15:29.862 --> 15:30.655
[feet stomping]
[跺脚]

15:35.689 --> 15:37.965
OH, PLANKTON?
哦，浮游生物？

15:37.965 --> 15:39.482
- YOU CAN'’T HIDE FOREVER.
- 你不能永远隐藏。

15:39.482 --> 15:41.275
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

15:41.275 --> 15:44.206
- LOOKS LIKE YOU'’VE GOT
A LOT ON YOUR MIND.
- 看起来你已经得到了
你心里有很多想法。

16:00.275 --> 16:04.379
- ALL RIGHT, PLANKTON,
END OF THE LINE.
- 好吧，浮游生物，
线路结束。

16:04.379 --> 16:06.103
PLANKTON?
浮游生物？

16:06.103 --> 16:08.241
- OVER HERE, CHOO-CHOO HEADS.
- 在这里，嘟嘟的头。

16:08.241 --> 16:09.965
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

16:12.103 --> 16:13.103
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:16.586 --> 16:18.206
- WELL, THAT WAS ODD.
- 嗯，这很奇怪。

16:18.206 --> 16:20.620
- YEAH, AND PLANKTON
STILL HAS THE KEY.
- 是的，还有浮游生物
仍然有钥匙。

16:20.620 --> 16:22.517
[engine chugging]
[发动机嘎嘎作响]

16:22.517 --> 16:23.517
[pounding]
[重击]

16:26.379 --> 16:30.034
PATRICK,
WE'’VE GOT A BIG PROBLEM.
帕特里克，
我们遇到了大问题。

16:30.034 --> 16:31.586
LOOK.
看。

16:31.586 --> 16:36.448
- HEY, WHERE ARE ALL THOSE...
SHINY TUBES?
- 嘿，那些都在哪里......
闪亮的管子？

16:36.448 --> 16:37.931
- THAT'’S JUST IT, PATRICK.
- 就是这样，帕特里克。

16:37.931 --> 16:40.344
THEY AREN'’T THERE.
他们不在那儿。

16:40.344 --> 16:41.689
- HMM.
- 唔。

16:41.689 --> 16:44.172
IN THAT CASE...
在这种情况下...

16:44.172 --> 16:47.965
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

16:47.965 --> 16:49.758
- HEY, WHAT'’S GOING ON?
- 嘿，发生了什么事？

16:49.758 --> 16:51.000
- I GOT PLACES TO BE.
- 我还有地方要去。

16:51.000 --> 16:52.310
- LET'’S GO, ALREADY.
- 我们走吧。

16:57.310 --> 16:59.241
- IT'’S TOO EASY.
- 这太简单了。

17:01.551 --> 17:03.068
[engine chugging]
[发动机嘎嘎作响]

17:03.068 --> 17:05.862
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

17:11.206 --> 17:12.965
- PATRICK, WE HAVE TO STOP
THIS THING.
- 帕特里克，我们必须停下来
这件事。

17:12.965 --> 17:14.689
GO SEE IF YOU CAN DO SOMETHING
WITH THAT STUFF.
去看看你是否能做点什么
有了那些东西。

17:14.689 --> 17:16.241
I'’LL TRY TO GET THE DOOR OPEN.
我会尽力把门打开。

17:16.241 --> 17:18.862
- WHAT DO I DO?
WHAT DO I DO?
- 我该怎么办？
我该怎么办？

17:18.862 --> 17:22.724
B-R-A-K-E.
制动。

17:22.724 --> 17:23.724
BRAKE.
制动。

17:23.724 --> 17:25.310
I CAN DO THAT.
我能做到。

17:25.310 --> 17:29.344
WELL, SPONGEBOB,
I THINK OUR TROUBLES ARE OVER.
嗯，海绵宝宝，
我想我们的麻烦已经结束了。

17:29.344 --> 17:30.827
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

17:30.827 --> 17:32.379
YOU BROKE THE BREAK?
你打破了休息吗？

17:32.379 --> 17:34.241
- IT TOLD ME TO.
- 它告诉我的。

17:34.241 --> 17:35.620
- WHAT WILL WE DO NOW?
- 我们现在该怎么办？

17:35.620 --> 17:36.965
OH, ONE OF THESE
THING-A-MA-WHOSIES
哦，其中之一
东西-A-MA-WHOSIES

17:36.965 --> 17:37.965
HAS TO STOP THE TRAIN.
必须停下火车。

17:37.965 --> 17:39.655
PATRICK, TRY SOMETHING!
帕特里克，尝试一下！

17:39.655 --> 17:41.310
- I'’M ON IT.
- 我已经开始了。

17:41.310 --> 17:44.068
MAYBE SHOVELING IN
THESE BLACK ROCKS WILL HELP.
也许铲进去
这些黑色岩石会有所帮助。

17:44.068 --> 17:46.068
[flames whooshing]
[火焰呼啸]

17:46.068 --> 17:49.482
[engine chugging faster]
[发动机运转得更快]

17:49.482 --> 17:52.275
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

17:55.310 --> 17:56.793
[electronic beeping]
[电子蜂鸣声]

17:56.793 --> 17:58.827
- [over radio] HELP US!
- PLEASE HELP US!
- [通过无线电]帮助我们！
- 请帮助我们！

17:58.827 --> 18:01.241
both: WE'’RE ON
AN OUT-OF-CONTROL TRAIN!
两人：我们都在
失控的火车！

18:01.241 --> 18:03.344
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

18:03.344 --> 18:04.896
THIS IS CENTRAL CONTROL
TO ENGINE FIVE.
这是中央控制
到五号发动机。

18:04.896 --> 18:07.172
DO YOU COPY?
- OH, WELL, YES SIR, I COPY.
你抄袭吗？
- 哦，好的，是的，先生，我收到。

18:07.172 --> 18:09.724
I'’M SPONGEBOB, AND I'’M
ON AN OUT-OF-CONTROL TRAIN.
我是海绵宝宝，而且我是
在失控的火车上。

18:09.724 --> 18:11.827
- KID, LET ME TALK
TO THE ENGINEER.
- 孩子，让我谈谈
致工程师。

18:11.827 --> 18:13.000
- UMM...WHO?
- 嗯……谁？

18:13.000 --> 18:14.758
- THE GUY DRIVING THE TRAIN.
- 开火车的人。

18:14.758 --> 18:16.724
- OH, UM...THAT WOULD BE ME.
- 哦，嗯……那就是我。

18:16.724 --> 18:18.172
AND PATRICK'’S HERE TOO.
帕特里克也在这里。

18:18.172 --> 18:19.241
SAY HI TO THE NICE GENTLEMAN,
PATRICK.
向善良的绅士问好，
帕特里克。

18:19.241 --> 18:20.620
- HI.
- 你好。

18:20.620 --> 18:21.551
- OH, THE BACK OF THE TRAIN
IS GONE!
- 哦，火车后面
不见了！

18:21.551 --> 18:23.310
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

18:23.310 --> 18:25.000
THAT TRAIN'’S HEADED
STRAIGHT FOR THE REST HOME.
那列火车正驶向
直接前往休息之家。

18:27.931 --> 18:29.862
AND THAT MEANS--
- MEANS WHAT? MEANS WHAT?
这意味着——
- 意味着什么？意味着什么？

18:29.862 --> 18:31.620
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN, MISTER?
先生，这是什么意思？

18:31.620 --> 18:33.275
- IT MEANS THAT TRAIN
IS COMING RIGHT THROUGH THAT--
- 这意味着火车
即将到来——

18:33.275 --> 18:35.793
crash!
碰撞！

18:35.793 --> 18:39.310
BEWARE THE TWISTED TRESTLES,
KID.
当心扭曲的支架，
孩子。

18:39.310 --> 18:40.758
- WHAT IS THAT?
- 那是什么？

18:40.758 --> 18:43.206
- THAT'’S THAT.
- 就是这样。

18:43.206 --> 18:44.344
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

18:44.344 --> 18:47.137
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

18:48.482 --> 18:51.275
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

18:57.344 --> 18:59.068
both: THAT WAS FUN.
两人：这很有趣。

18:59.068 --> 19:02.241
- YEAH, NOW, WHERE WERE WE?
- 是啊，现在，我们在哪里？

19:02.241 --> 19:03.241
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

19:03.241 --> 19:04.551
I'’LL SAVE US.
我会拯救我们。

19:04.551 --> 19:07.344
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:14.862 --> 19:17.655
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:19.896 --> 19:22.172
ICE-COLD LEMONADE.
冰镇柠檬水。

19:22.172 --> 19:24.896
GET YOUR ICE-COLD,
TASTY, REFRESHING,
让你的冰冷，
美味、清爽、

19:24.896 --> 19:28.551
AND ALSO ICE-COLD--
HEY.
还有冰冷的——
嘿。

19:28.551 --> 19:31.172
EVERYONE STOPS
FOR FREE LEMONADE!
每个人都停下来
免费柠檬水！

19:31.172 --> 19:34.862
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:34.862 --> 19:36.448
- ATTABOY, PATRICK.
- 阿塔博伊，帕特里克。

19:36.448 --> 19:39.034
DON'’T GIVE--
[screaming]
不要给予——
[尖叫]

19:39.034 --> 19:41.137
- I'’M A HERO!
- 我是英雄！

19:41.137 --> 19:43.586
crash!
碰撞！

19:43.586 --> 19:44.586
[metal scraping]
[金属刮削]

19:44.586 --> 19:47.310
HEY, WAIT FOR ME.
嘿，等我。

19:47.310 --> 19:50.103
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:50.103 --> 19:52.551
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

19:52.551 --> 19:53.551
HEY, SPONGEBOB.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

19:53.551 --> 19:55.724
[engine chugging]
[发动机嘎嘎作响]

19:55.724 --> 19:57.689
- WHOA!
- 哇！

19:57.689 --> 20:00.517
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

20:00.517 --> 20:02.000
[rocks shattering]
[岩石碎裂]

20:02.000 --> 20:04.793
[engine chugging]
[发动机嘎嘎作响]

20:06.655 --> 20:08.655
- THERE'’S A TRAIN BEHIND YOU.
- 你身后有一列火车。

20:08.655 --> 20:10.931
- HOW MANY TIMES YOU THINK
I'’M FALLING FOR THAT ONE?
- 你想了多少次
我爱上那个人了吗？

20:10.931 --> 20:12.655
- HEY, WOULD YOU
QUIT MESSING AROUND?
- 嘿，你愿意吗
别再胡闹了？

20:12.655 --> 20:14.241
YOU'’RE MAKING ME SICK.
你让我恶心了。

20:14.241 --> 20:17.206
- [stammering]
- [结巴]

20:17.206 --> 20:20.827
[brakes squealing]
[刹车尖叫声]

20:20.827 --> 20:23.620
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

20:28.172 --> 20:30.965
- HEY.
- 嘿。

20:30.965 --> 20:32.758
both: WHEW.
两人：哇。

20:32.758 --> 20:34.517
- SORRY, OLDSTERS.
- 对不起，长辈们。

20:34.517 --> 20:36.034
WE'’D LOVE TO STAY AND HELP YOU
CLEAN UP THE MESS,
我们很乐意留下来为您提供帮助
清理混乱，

20:36.034 --> 20:38.137
BUT WE'’VE GOT A FORMULA TO SAVE.
但我们有一个可以保存的公式。

20:38.137 --> 20:39.896
[train whistle blowing]
【火车鸣笛】

20:39.896 --> 20:42.068
[wheels grinding]
[砂轮磨削]

20:42.068 --> 20:43.310
[engine chugging]
[发动机嘎嘎作响]

20:43.310 --> 20:45.448
- HMM...
- 唔...

20:45.448 --> 20:49.448
T-H-R-O-T-T-L-E.
风门。

20:49.448 --> 20:50.448
BREAK!
休息！

20:50.448 --> 20:52.448
HA, I CAN DO THAT.
哈，我能做到。

20:52.448 --> 20:54.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

20:54.448 --> 20:56.034
[metal snapping]
[金属折断]

20:56.034 --> 20:58.862
YOU DIDN'’T NEED THIS, DID YOU?
您不需要这个，是吗？

20:58.862 --> 21:01.862
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

21:03.413 --> 21:06.413
- [laughing melodically]
- [有旋律的笑声]

21:06.413 --> 21:08.137
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

21:08.137 --> 21:09.827
COME TO PAPA.
来爸爸吧。

21:12.413 --> 21:16.448
AT LAST, MY DAY OF TRIUMPH
HAS COME.
最后，我的胜利之日
已经来了。

21:16.448 --> 21:17.448
AGAIN.
再次。

21:17.448 --> 21:20.965
- WELL, WELL.
- 好吧，好吧。

21:20.965 --> 21:22.379
- WHAT?
- 什么？

21:22.379 --> 21:24.172
BUT--BUT HOW?
但是——但是怎么办？

21:24.172 --> 21:26.241
- YOU HONESTLY DIDN'’T THINK
I WOULD'’VE LEFT YOU
- 老实说你没想到
我会离开你

21:26.241 --> 21:28.275
OUT OF THIS ELABORATE EQUATION,
DID YA?
根据这个复杂的方程，
是吗？

21:28.275 --> 21:30.517
- I CAN EXPLAIN, EUGENE.
- 我可以解释，尤金。

21:30.517 --> 21:34.034
I WAS JUST KEEPING
IT WARM FOR YA, YEAH.
我只是保留
对你来说很温暖，是的。

21:34.034 --> 21:37.689
- SURE.
I BELIEVE YA.
- 当然。
我相信你。

21:37.689 --> 21:41.034
SAY, SINCE YOU WENT THROUGH ALL
THE TROUBLE OF GETTING HERE...
说吧，既然你经历了这一切
到达这里的麻烦......

21:41.034 --> 21:42.689
THERE YOU GO, PLANKTON.
好了，浮游生物。

21:42.689 --> 21:44.448
ENJOY THE SCENERY.
欣赏风景。

21:44.448 --> 21:45.896
HEY, WHERE'’D HE GO?
嘿，他去哪儿了？

21:45.896 --> 21:47.620
- CHECKMATE, KRABS.
- 将死，蟹蟹。

21:47.620 --> 21:50.482
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

21:50.482 --> 21:52.275
crash!
碰撞！

21:56.275 --> 21:59.034
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

22:00.689 --> 22:01.965
- GOOD JOB, BOY-O.
- 干得好，男孩。

22:01.965 --> 22:03.793
- I SIMPLY REFUSE TO FAIL, SIR.
- 我只是拒绝失败，先生。

22:03.793 --> 22:04.931
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

22:04.931 --> 22:06.655
THAT'’S ALL VERY WONDERFUL,
这一切都非常美妙，

22:06.655 --> 22:08.241
BUT WOULD YOU MIND TELLING ME
HOW YOU INTEND TO PAY
但你介意告诉我吗
您打算如何付款

22:08.241 --> 22:09.931
FOR THE DAMAGE TO THE BANK?
对银行造成损害？

22:09.931 --> 22:11.724
- EH...
-呃……

22:11.724 --> 22:13.241
YOU KNOW, I JUST REMEMBERED
你知道，我刚刚记得

22:13.241 --> 22:14.620
I'’M LATE
FOR A VERY IMPORTANT MEETING.
我迟到了
参加一次非常重要的会议。

22:14.620 --> 22:15.862
TAKE CARE OF IT, WILL YA, BOY?
照顾好它，好吗，男孩？

22:15.862 --> 22:18.000
- NOT SO FAST, KRABS.
- 别那么快，蟹蟹。

22:18.000 --> 22:20.689
LOOKS LIKE YOU'’VE GOT
JUST ENOUGH IN YOUR BANK ACCOUNT
看起来你已经有了
您的银行账户里的钱就够了

22:20.689 --> 22:22.827
TO COVER THE COST.
支付费用。

22:22.827 --> 22:31.034
- NO!
- 不！

22:34.793 --> 22:38.827
- AND THAT WAS THE STORY
OF THE GREAT TRAIN CAPER.
- 这就是故事
伟大的火车冒险。

22:38.827 --> 22:40.655
DIDN'’T YA FIND IT EXCITING?
您不觉得它令人兴奋吗？

22:40.655 --> 22:42.310
- [shushing]
- [嘘]

22:42.310 --> 22:44.206
I JUST BEAT MY HIGH SCORE.
我刚刚打破了我的最高分。

22:44.206 --> 22:45.896
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

22:45.896 --> 22:48.034
- EH, KIDS TODAY.
- 呃，今天的孩子们。

22:48.034 --> 22:50.655
[snoring]
[打鼾]

22:53.896 --> 22:56.758
